            <span class="customer-logo"><img src="assets/logos/dreamcash.png" alt="Dreamcash" class="clogo">Dreamcash</span>
            <span class="customer-logo"><img src="assets/logos/Outcome.jpg" alt="Outcome" class="clogo">Outcome</span>
